      "answer": "Developers adding a new top-level module, and PR reviewers. The failure this prevents is specific: someone creates src/vibey/\u003cnewthing\u003e/ and it lands outside all four per-layer gates, so CI reports 100% while the module is untested. That already happened once -- it is how tui/ reached 84% unnoticed. Reviewers benefit because 'coverage is green' becomes a statement about the whole tree instead of four subdirectories of it.",
